{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check out our next cozy game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/Frame_405.png?t=1727815132\" />Watermelon Suika Game also known as the Watermelon Game, is a casual and addictive game where the goal is to stack and combine fruits of different sizes to create larger watermelons. The game mechanics resemble a &quot;match-3&quot; style, but with a fun twist where the fruits fall and roll across the screen with dynamic physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/01.gif?t=1727815132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, fruits appear at the top of the screen and fall randomly. When two fruits of the same type touch, they merge to form a larger fruit. For example, two cherries combine to form a grape, two grapes combine to form a peach, and so on, until they form a watermelon. The challenge lies in managing the growing stack of fruits without letting them overflow the game area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/animals_gif-1.gif?t=1727815132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suika Game has gained popularity for its simple and relaxing gameplay, becoming a hit among players looking for a light and fun pastime. Now available on Steam, the game is perfect for those seeking a casual and engaging experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2722740?t=1727815132","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1727815132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it